\f0\b\fs34\fsmilli17333 \cf2 Prerequisites (the substrate floor)\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa186\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs29\fsmilli14667 \cf2 The engine assumes a working substrate. It is a stated prerequisite, not auto-provisioned:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa186\partightenfactor0
\ls3\ilvl0\cf2 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Claude Code CLI, version 2.1.302 or later (the version this package is built and tested against; the engine's settings keep Claude Code from updating below it but do not stop an older install from starting, so check with 
\f3\fs25\fsmilli12667 claude --version
\f1\fs29\fsmilli14667 )\
\ls3\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 git\
\ls3\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 a git remote for the spine: a private hosted repository (GitHub or any other host) or a bare repository on the same machine\
\ls3\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 tmux\
\ls3\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 python3 (the boot check and several probes run on it)\
\ls3\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
