\f0\b\fs34\fsmilli17333 \cf2 Quick start\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa186\partightenfactor0
\ls4\ilvl0
\f1\b0\fs29\fsmilli14667 \cf2 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	1	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Download the engine zip from the release, and verify it against SHA256SUMS before use.\
\ls4\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	2	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Unzip with a tool that keeps file modes (
\f3\fs25\fsmilli12667 unzip
\f1\fs29\fsmilli14667  does; the zip records which scripts are executable), then confirm integrity from inside the unzipped package: run 
\f3\fs25\fsmilli12667 sha256sum -c MANIFEST.sha256
\f1\fs29\fsmilli14667  (every line must report OK, or stop and report).\
\ls4\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	3	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Adopt: read 
\f3\fs25\fsmilli12667 ADOPTION-COVER.md
\f1\fs29\fsmilli14667  from the unzipped package and follow it. Adoption runs in four ordered phases (assess, your explicit go, instantiation fills, implementation); 
\f3\fs25\fsmilli12667 GETTING-STARTED-LINUX-MAC.md
\f1\fs29\fsmilli14667  walks them from a blank machine. The launcher comes last, not here: 
\f3\fs25\fsmilli12667 ./launch-orc.sh
\f1\fs29\fsmilli14667  boots a seat that already exists, so running it before the project is instantiated halts by design.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa186\partightenfactor0
\cf2 The package ships FOUNDATION.md as a skeleton with authoring instructions, and the canon carries an instantiation checklist (section 12) for standing up a new project, including the seeded-fault run (step 8) that proves the controls exist.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa160\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs34\fsmilli17333 \cf2 Verify\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa186\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs29\fsmilli14667 \cf2 Every download is cited on two axes together: the engine package version and the canon pin (the specification version the engine ships and conforms to). Verify on both surfaces before use: run 
\f3\fs25\fsmilli12667 sha256sum -c SHA256SUMS
\f1\fs29\fsmilli14667  to confirm the release files (the engine zip, this README in both formats, LICENSE, the manifest and the provenance), then unzip and run 
\f3\fs25\fsmilli12667 sha256sum -c MANIFEST.sha256
\f1\fs29\fsmilli14667  to confirm the package contents, including the canon (pin v1.6.8). Fingerprints for the current release are on https://gmaa.ai/versions.html.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa160\partightenfactor0

